  "_note": "Bow Tie disguise: two sequential gesture windows (shot 24 play-through OI pattern). intro plays, then oi_hat/mid/oi_coat/outro play straight through. oi_hat arms touch_head (both hands to crown, AL-08-005); oi_coat arms arms_crossed (AL-08-006). Each plays a reaction sfx + green flash on detection; the hat/coat-appearing animation is baked into the frames and plays regardless (non-blocking). Flip a state to loop:true to make it pause/block on the gesture. Shot base global frame = 30060; INT hands-on-head 30708-30880, INT cross-arms 31156-31330. hat.mp3/coat.mp3 are placeholders.",
